<title>USA: AMRE says two board members resigned.</title>
<headline>AMRE says two board members resigned.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMRE Inc on Friday said Robert Pittman and Arthur Frigo resigned from the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>Pittman recently became president and chief executive officer of America Online and cited time contraints as the reason for his departure, the company said.</p>
<p>Frigo is president of M.B. Walton Co.</p>
